Modifications made in this work, on 2026-09-01:
  - Extracted the Bangladesh SMS parsers from Cashiro's `parser-core` module
    into a standalone library; removed the 129 parsers for other countries and
    the base classes supporting them (BaseIndianBankParser, BaseIranianBankParser,
    BaseThailandBankParser, UAEBankParser) along with their tests.
  - Renamed the Kotlin package from `com.ritesh.parser.core` to `me.shovon.bdparser`.
  - Trimmed `BankParserFactory` to register only the nine Bangladesh parsers.
  - Changed the default currency on `ParsedTransaction` from INR to BDT.
  - Made the transaction-hash hex conversion locale-independent.
  - Pinned an explicit Java 11 compilation target.

