Further modifications for the alpha budget app (github.com/fahimscirex/alpha), on 2026-10-03:
  - Replaced java.time.LocalDate with SimpleDate so the parsers run on Android 7
    (API 24); dropped the unused BalanceUpdateInfo.asOfDate.
  - Defaulted BankParser.getCurrency() to BDT instead of INR.
  - Bank parsers reject SMS quoting a foreign-currency amount instead of
    recording it as taka.
  - Masked account numbers keep only the digits after the mask ("123***456"
    is "456", not "3456").
  - Eastern Bank: one pattern for every account credit/debit reason, with the
    "Balance is BDT Y" balance; card alerts with or without the "EBL CARDS:"
    prefix; debit-card purchases with the linked account balance; QR payments.
  - MFS fees surfaced as ParsedTransaction.fee.
  - Added RealSampleTest with real EBL and bKash messages (numbers replaced).
